WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.847
Week 36: Integrated Field Capstone. manage an unfamiliar situation brief and persuade reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan

2
00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:24.332
Form and meaning. Applying the form. Integrated proficiency means self-monitoring in real time, choosing repair strategies strategically, and sustaining intelligibility across a long interaction — not using every structure perfectly.

3
00:00:24.332 --> 00:00:54.665
Model set. Me monitoreo mientras hablo. Reparo un error de forma estratégica. Adapto mi registro según la situación. Sostengo una conversación larga sin perder el hilo. Tolero la variación regional sin juzgar. I monitor myself while I speak. I repair a mistake strategically. I adapt my register to the situation. I sustain a long conversation without losing the thread. I tolerate regional variation without judging it.

4
00:00:54.665 --> 00:01:04.795
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:01:04.795 --> 00:01:18.637
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: manage an unfamiliar situation; brief and persuade; reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:18.637 --> 00:01:49.951
Model language. Me monitoreo mientras hablo. — I monitor myself while I speak. Reparo un error de forma estratégica. — I repair a mistake strategically. Adapto mi registro según la situación. — I adapt my register to the situation. Sostengo una conversación larga sin perder el hilo. — I sustain a long conversation without losing the thread. Tolero la variación regional sin juzgar. — I tolerate regional variation without judging it.

7
00:01:49.951 --> 00:01:59.699
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
